INFO 2026-05-03 14:42:45,051 accounts.api_io [request_id=3C9D480B-E327-4377-B137-2CA85392A0A0] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=18 bytes=3961 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDUtMDJUMDM6MzY6NTIuNDExNDU0KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIyMjI5In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "d9e8f908-c3a6-4845-8d70-9331f69a0947", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "c2bb09db-f06b-48f8-be95-56c3bc403bbc", "server_message_id": "aa739043-61e6-4b47-9bba-194756dcadd3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-02T03:02:28.917000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-02T03:02:29.044766+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "00F11C96-83A8-4F0E-B451-08C1084F4BCD", "kind": "text", "text": "嘿我昨天的睡眠情况怎么样", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:28.917Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:28.917Z"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d9e8f908-c3a6-4845-8d70-9331f69a0947", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "b9bb2026-2194-4559-9258-08f8d4a0f7a3", "server_message_id": "1fe41167-dac7-4a76-9ec0-e6923426f174", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-02T03:02:53.498000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-02T03:36:52.411454+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "E0B64B3B-3707-454B-8DD1-79019D854490", "kind": "text", "text": "好的，让我帮你查一下昨天的睡眠数据。先确认一下当前成员信息，然后拉取数据。", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:30.953Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:31.807Z"}, {"id": "525452B8-C0DD-434A-AEC1-BBF71BAF0753", "kind": "tool", "text": "正在使用工具：获取当前成员\n当前未选择成员。", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_XzwoOp7bCtnUM0U5ZcpHHX5X"}, "toolName": "get_current_member", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:32.335Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:32.550Z", "toolCallID": "call_00_XzwoOp7bCtnUM0U5ZcpHHX5X"}, {"id": "1B1CDBAD-3807-4775-B435-71ED04183EF0", "kind": "text", "text": "需要先选择成员才能查看你的睡眠数据。让我帮你调出成员选择。", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:35.831Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:36.618Z"}, {"id": "EAFC5C2E-FC55-4E96-B902-2625256A10D4", "kind": "tool", "text": "正在使用工具：请求选择成员\n用户已完成成员选择。请使用返回的 member_id 继续后续工具调用或生成最终回答。\n{\"selection_completed\":true,\"member_id\":29,\"instruction\":\"continue_conversation\"}", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_TMCbLm8lBeXoBc3bZWdSoifG"}, "toolName": "request_member_selection", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:37.145Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:42.766Z", "toolCallID": "call_00_TMCbLm8lBeXoBc3bZWdSoifG"}, {"id": "FEC0E03F-0673-4DB9-BA67-198E6056A9C3", "kind": "text", "text": "好的，已确认成员。现在让我拉取你昨天的睡眠数据。", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:45.440Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:45.989Z"}, {"id": "719500AA-3349-4B82-8C9F-68F29C9ECA7B", "kind": "tool", "text": "正在使用工具：睡眠详情\n睡眠查询失败：没有查到查询日期内的睡眠记录。", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_oq14otgifkHnTT6w43bKzVGg"}, "toolName": "fetch_sleep_details", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:46.463Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:47.795Z", "toolCallID": "call_00_oq14otgifkHnTT6w43bKzVGg"}, {"id": "ED199B79-AAEA-4C22-BB24-FD67396617A1", "kind": "text", "text": "嗯，系统显示**昨天（12月16日）没有睡眠记录**。这可能是以下几种情况：\n\n1. **设备未佩戴或未同步** — 睡觉时没有佩戴手环/手表，或者数据还没同步到系统。\n2. **睡眠时间跨天** — 如果你是在12月15日晚上入睡、12月16日起床，睡眠数据可能被记录在15日那天。\n\n要不要我帮你查一下**12月15日**的睡眠数据？或者你也可以检查一下设备是否正常同步。", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:49.731Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-02T03:02:53.473Z"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
