\n\\n### 其他系统潜在不良反应\\n1. **消化系统**：偶见厌食、胆石症、食欲增加、黑便、口腔溃疡、胃肠溃疡等；罕见结肠炎、呕血、肝肿大、黄疸等\\n2. **代谢和营养**：常见外周水肿、痛风、高","toolName":"create_knowledge_document","id":"A603C44C-B901-4692-A4EF-6A33805D20CB","createdAt":"2026-05-03T15:49:33.680Z"}]},{"thread_id":"a68ce27d-db6b-4a0a-92d0-fa3fd2f6346f","role":"system","model_name":"system","client_message_id":"bd150a4c-2b10-455a-89e9-e44fca8ed82e","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-05-03 15:50:19.651000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":4096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","thread_system_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。","blocks":[{"text":"🛑 响应已打断","updatedAt":"2026-05-03T15:50:19.651Z","id":"C879A668-1CE8-4D56-B1F8-B8CFA95DD5A2","kind":"text","createdAt":"2026-05-03T15:50:19.651Z"}]}]}
